<title>INDIA: India's RBI raises 51.5 bln rupees at repo auction.</title>
<headline>India's RBI raises 51.5 bln rupees at repo auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Monday it maintained a cut-off rate of 4.05 percent at a repo auction.</p>
<p>RBI said it received 13 bids for 52.50 billion rupees of which it accepted 12 for 51.5 billion rupees.  </p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off rate was 4.0063 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
